OL,4,CMan 'startled' after garden fell into  
OL,5,Csinkhole                               
OL,6,GA man has said he was "startled and    
OL,7,Gshocked" to wake up to find his front  
OL,8,Ggarden had collapsed into a sinkhole.  
OL,10,FSam Colin-Jones' property was one of   
OL,11,Fthree homes that needed to be          
OL,12,Fevacuated after the sinkhole opened up 
OL,13,Fin Halstead Way, in Allington,         
OL,14,FMaidstone, on Thursday morning.        
OL,16,FThe hole measured about 9ft deep (3m)  
OL,17,Fand 32ft (10m) long. No injuries were  
OL,18,Freported, Kent Fire and Rescue Service 
OL,19,F(KFRS) said.                           
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
