OL,4,CNo evidence parking site fire was      
OL,5,Carson - police                         
OL,6,GNo evidence has been found that        
OL,7,Gsuggests a fire at a third-party car   
OL,8,Gparking facility used by Gatwick       
OL,9,GAirport passengers was started         
OL,10,Gdeliberately, police say.              
OL,12,FAbout 140 vehicles were thought to     
OL,13,Fhave been destroyed at Caldyne         
OL,14,FBusiness Park in Wallage Lane,         
OL,15,FRowfant, which broke out shortly after 
OL,16,F21:00 BST on 22 August.                
OL,18,FSussex Police said it has concluded    
OL,19,Fits investigation, and two men who had 
OL,20,Fpreviously been arrested will face no  
OL,21,Ffurther action.                        
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
