OL,4,CLong delays on M25 due to tunnel defect
OL,5,GMotorists faced long queues on the M25 
OL,6,Gas one of the tunnels at the Dartford  
OL,7,GCrossing was closed earlier due to a   
OL,8,Gdefect being found.                    
OL,10,FNational Highways said it was          
OL,11,Fdiscovered during overnight works,     
OL,12,Fmeaning it could not reopen at 05:00   
OL,13,FGMT on Monday as was scheduled.        
OL,15,FShortly after 14:30, National Highways 
OL,16,Fsaid repairs had been completed and    
OL,17,Fthe east bore of the tunnel had        
OL,18,Freopened, but delays remained.         
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
