OL,4,CPattinson will be 'different', says ex-
OL,5,CBond stuntwoman                        
OL,6,G"He looks different to the others, but 
OL,7,GI guess they've done that on purpose." 
OL,9,FThat is the verdict of 88-year-old     
OL,10,Fformer stunt double Jenny Le Fre, who  
OL,11,Ffeatured in early James Bond films, on 
OL,12,Fthe casting of Robert Pattinson as the 
OL,13,Fnext 007.                              
OL,15,FThe pensioner worked with Sean Connery 
OL,16,Fand Roger Moore on previous films in   
OL,17,Fthe franchise and now resides in a     
OL,18,Fcare home in Egham, Surrey.            
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
